px;\">A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 18 de outubro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 09h30 na Avenida do Brasil, em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza a Meia Maratona oficial de 21,0975 km e a Corrida \/ Caminhada de 10 km aberta a todas as idades.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o levantamento do kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais e kits de atleta s\u00e3o entregues nos Servi\u00e7os Educativos do Parque da Devesa na v\u00e9spera do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O percurso \u00e9 favor\u00e1vel a recordes pessoais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o tra\u00e7ado em piso de asfalto pelas avenidas centrais de Famalic\u00e3o \u00e9 plano, r\u00e1pido e totalmente fechado ao tr\u00e2nsito.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem no portal da Runporto com liga\u00e7\u00e3o direta dispon\u00edvel no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"12\u00aa Meia Maratona de Famalic\u00e3o 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida do Brasil \/ Parque do CITEVE, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Runporto e Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Meia Maratona de Famalic\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 18 de outubro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 09h30 na Avenida do Brasil, em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as 